<p>Hi there, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/orionsmith" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6594992); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6594992&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1593838539" alt="Orionsmith" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6594992)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/orionsmith" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6594992); return false;">Orionsmith</a></span>! I'm an author on this site as well as a member of Community Outreach. I'm glad to see you decide to join us! Just so you know, the majority of our readers skip around, so don't feel bad about that. I happen to be a tater man myself, which leads me to give you <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-1689">this recommendation</a>. The following are a couple of tips to help you navigate our beloved wiki as well as some recommendations for you to check out!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+Here&nbsp;you&nbsp;go!</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-Hope&nbsp;this&nbsp;helps!</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<ul>
<li>If you happen to find an article you that you really enjoy, you can try finding more content from the same author by looking them up on the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/members-pages">Authors' Page</a> hub.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>We have a very large collection of wonderful articles here on the wiki. However, a natural drawback to such a collection is that it is difficult to curate content to a user’s personal taste. As it stands, there is no way to search for content by genre. With the help of various community members, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/user-curated-lists">User-Curated Lists</a> was created to facilitate personal playlists of some amazing content to our users!</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>This should be plenty to get you well on your way! Let me know if this message was helpful at all, and if there's anything important you think I may have missed. Feel free to message me or others on the Community Outreach team if you have any questions. Welcome to the SCP Foundation Wiki!</p>

